# =============================================================================
# Airport Tracker API — VS Code REST Client Collection
# Install VS Code Extension: "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
# =============================================================================

@baseUrl = https://charlie-meader.com
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8787

# Paste your generated `atk_...` API key here (or use `{{$dotenv ATK_API_KEY}}` if you created a `.env` file):
@token = {{$dotenv ATK_API_KEY}}
@username = CharlieM312


# =============================================================================
# 1. AUTHENTICATION & API KEY BOOTSTRAP
# =============================================================================

### Step 1: Login with Username & Password (+ optional 6-digit TOTP code)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "your-password",
  "totp_code": ""
}

### Step 2: Generate a Personal Access Token (`atk_...`) using the login session above
# @name createApiKey
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "VS Code REST Client",
  "expires_in_days": 365
}


# =============================================================================
# 2. ACCOUNT, 2FA, SESSIONS & API KEYS (Uses `@token` / `atk_...`)
# =============================================================================

### Check 2FA, Passkeys, Linked OAuth Accounts & Admin Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/2fa/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Personal Access Tokens / API Keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke an API Key by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/api-keys/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Active Multi-Device Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke All Other Device Sessions
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions?all_others=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change / Set Password (PBKDF2-SHA256)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "your-current-password",
  "new_password": "your-new-secure-password",
  "revoke_other_sessions": false
}

### Edit Your Own Username (Updates users, airport_visits, passkeys, OAuth, sessions & API keys)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/user/username
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "new_username": "CharlieM312"
}


# =============================================================================
# 3. ADMIN USER APPROVAL & MANAGEMENT (Requires Admin `@token`)
# =============================================================================

### List All Users & Pending Approval Queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Only Pending Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve (or Reject / Rename) a User
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/pending_user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "role": "user"
}

### Delete a Pending or Rejected User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/pending_user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# =============================================================================
# 4. PUBLIC READ ENDPOINTS (Visits, Airports & Travel Stats)
# =============================================================================

### Get Logged Airport Visits
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits?username={{username}}&limit=50

### Get Distinct Visited Airports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/airports?username={{username}}&distinct=true

### Get Travel Statistics & Total Distance Flown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats?username={{username}}

### Search Reference Airports by City / Name / IATA Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/airports?search=London

### Lookup Single Reference Airport by IATA Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/airports?code=LHR


# =============================================================================
# 5. PROTECTED WRITE ENDPOINTS (Log, Edit & Delete Visits using `@token`)
# =============================================================================

### Log a Single Airport Visit (Auto-calculates Haversine distance_km from origin_iata)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iata_code": "HAM",
  "origin_iata": "LHR",
  "visit_date": "2026-11-18",
  "flight_number": "BA968",
  "notes": "Logged from VS Code REST Client"
}

### Batch Log Multiple Visits in an Atomic D1 Transaction
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visits": [
    {
      "iata_code": "NCL",
      "origin_iata": "LHR",
      "visit_date": "2026-10-12",
      "flight_number": "BA1326",
      "notes": "Domestic flight north"
    },
    {
      "iata_code": "AMS",
      "origin_iata": "NCL",
      "visit_date": "2026-10-14",
      "flight_number": "KL958",
      "notes": "Hop across the North Sea"
    }
  ]
}

### Edit an Existing Visit by ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flight_number": "BA968",
  "notes": "Updated notes via REST Client"
}

### Delete a Visit by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add or Update an Airport in the Reference Table
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/airports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "iata_code": "LHR",
  "name": "London Heathrow Airport",
  "city": "London",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "latitude": 51.4700,
  "longitude": -0.4543
}
